<p>These pages help visitors explore the company&#39;s experience and understand the kinds of projects it handles.</p>
<p>They also give the website meaningful, specific content beyond a handful of generic service descriptions.</p></div></div><ol class="cs-workflow"><li><span>01</span> Document the Job</li><li><span>02</span> Prepare the Project</li><li><span>03</span> Publish the Work</li></ol>{{ screen('wsf-project-detail.png', 'Published West Stamford Fence page for a diamond post and rail white cedar fence installation in Stamford, Connecticut', 'A real published project page showing the public presentation of completed work.') }}</div></section>
